\par\pard\f0\fs28\b 8. N\u7897?i dung v\u224? d\u7919? li\u7879?u do ng\u432?\u7901?i d\u249?ng cung c\u7845?p\b0\par
\pard\f0\fs24 B\u7841?n ch\u7883?u tr\u225?ch nhi\u7879?m \u273?\u7889?i v\u7899?i m\u7885?i file ISO, script, file tr\u7843? l\u7901?i, c\u7845?u h\u236?nh, ch\u7913?ng ch\u7881?, driver v\u224? c\u225?c t\u224?i li\u7879?u kh\u225?c m\u224? b\u7841?n nh\u7853?p, t\u7841?o ho\u7863?c \u225?p d\u7909?ng th\u244?ng qua SEZOY. TekDT kh\u244?ng y\u234?u c\u7847?u quy\u7873?n s\u7903? h\u7919?u \u273?\u7889?i v\u7899?i n\u7897?i dung c\u7911?a b\u7841?n.\par
\pard\f0\fs24 B\u7841?n cam \u273?oan r\u7857?ng m\u236?nh c\u243? \u273?\u7847?y \u273?\u7911? quy\u7873?n ho\u7863?c s\u7921? cho ph\u233?p c\u7847?n thi\u7871?t \u273?\u7875? s\u7917? d\u7909?ng v\u224? x\u7917? l\u253? m\u7885?i n\u7897?i dung m\u224? b\u7841?n \u273?\u432?a v\u224?o ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m.\par
\par\pard\f0\fs28\b 9. C\u7853?p nh\u7853?t v\u224? thay \u273?\u7893?i\b0\par
\pard\f0\fs24 SEZOY c\u243? th\u7875? \u273?\u432?\u7907?c c\u7853?p nh\u7853?t t\u7921? \u273?\u7897?ng ho\u7863?c th\u7911? c\u244?ng. C\u225?c b\u7843?n c\u7853?p nh\u7853?t c\u243? th\u7875? b\u7893? sung, lo\u7841?i b\u7887? ho\u7863?c thay \u273?\u7893?i t\u237?nh n\u259?ng, ph\u7909? thu\u7897?c ho\u7863?c quy tr\u236?nh l\u224?m vi\u7879?c. TekDT c\u243? th\u7875? thay \u273?\u7893?i ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m, t\u224?i li\u7879?u, th\u224?nh ph\u7847?n \u273?i k\u232?m ho\u7863?c \u273?i\u7873?u kho\u7843?n c\u7845?p ph\u233?p v\u224?o b\u7845?t k\u7923? th\u7901?i \u273?i\u7875?m n\u224?o b\u7857?ng c\u225?ch c\u244?ng b\u7889? phi\u234?n b\u7843?n EULA c\u7853?p nh\u7853?t.\par
\par\pard\f0\fs28\b 10. H\u7895? tr\u7907? v\u224? t\u237?nh s\u7861?n s\u224?ng\b0\par
\pard\f0\fs24 Ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m \u273?\u432?\u7907?c cung c\u7845?p nh\u432? m\u7897?t c\u244?ng c\u7909? k\u7929? thu\u7853?t. TekDT kh\u244?ng \u273?\u7843?m b\u7843?o ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m lu\u244?n ho\u7841?t \u273?\u7897?ng li\u234?n t\u7909?c, t\u432?\u417?ng th\u237?ch v\u7899?i m\u7885?i thi\u7871?t b\u7883?, ho\u7863?c m\u7885?i b\u7843?n t\u7843?i xu\u7889?ng b\u234?n ngo\u224?i v\u224? d\u7883?ch v\u7909? b\u234?n th\u7913? ba s\u7869? lu\u244?n kh\u7843? d\u7909?ng.\par
\par\pard\f0\fs28\b 11. Mi\u7877?n tr\u7915? b\u7843?o h\u224?nh\b0\par
\pard\f0\fs24 TRONG PH\u7840?M VI PH\u193?P LU\u7852?T CHO PH\u201?P, PH\u7846?N M\u7872?M \u272?\u431?\u7906?C CUNG C\u7844?P "NGUY\u202?N TR\u7840?NG" V\u192? "THEO T\u204?NH TR\u7840?NG S\u7860?N C\u211?", KH\u212?NG K\u200?M B\u7844?T K\u7922? B\u7842?O \u272?\u7842?M N\u192?O, D\u217? R\u213? R\u192?NG, NG\u7846?M \u272?\u7882?NH HAY THEO QUY \u272?\u7882?NH PH\u193?P LU\u7852?T, BAO G\u7890?M NH\u431?NG KH\u212?NG GI\u7898?I H\u7840?N \u7902? B\u7842?O \u272?\u7842?M V\u7872? KH\u7842? N\u258?NG TH\u431?\u416?NG M\u7840?I, PH\u217? H\u7906?P V\u7898?I M\u7908?C \u272?\u205?CH C\u7908? TH\u7874?, KH\u212?NG X\u194?M PH\u7840?M QUY\u7872?N V\u192? \u272?\u7896? CH\u205?NH X\u193?C.\par
\pard\f0\fs24 TekDT kh\u244?ng b\u7843?o \u273?\u7843?m ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m s\u7869? lu\u244?n ho\u7841?t \u273?\u7897?ng tr\u234?n m\u7885?i h\u7879? th\u7889?ng, r\u7857?ng m\u244?i tr\u432?\u7901?ng Boot s\u7869? lu\u244?n th\u224?nh c\u244?ng, ho\u7863?c r\u7857?ng c\u225?c th\u224?nh ph\u7847?n b\u234?n th\u7913? ba s\u7869? lu\u244?n t\u432?\u417?ng th\u237?ch ho\u7863?c lu\u244?n kh\u7843? d\u7909?ng.\par
\par\pard\f0\fs28\b 12. Gi\u7899?i h\u7841?n tr\u225?ch nhi\u7879?m\b0\par
\pard\f0\fs24 TRONG PH\u7840?M VI PH\u193?P LU\u7852?T CHO PH\u201?P, TEKDT V\u192? C\u193?C \u272?\u211?NG G\u211?P VI\u202?N KH\u212?NG CH\u7882?U TR\u193?CH NHI\u7878?M \u272?\u7888?I V\u7898?I B\u7844?T K\u7922? THI\u7878?T H\u7840?I GI\u193?N TI\u7870?P, NG\u7850?U NHI\u202?N, \u272?\u7862?C BI\u7878?T, H\u7878? QU\u7842?, \u272?I\u7874?N H\u204?NH HO\u7862?C TR\u7914?NG PH\u7840?T N\u192?O; C\u360?NG NH\u431? M\u7844?T D\u7918? LI\u7878?U, M\u7844?T L\u7906?I NHU\u7852?N, H\u7886?NG H\u7878? TH\u7888?NG HO\u7862?C GI\u193?N \u272?O\u7840?N KINH DOANH PH\u193?T SINH T\u7914? HO\u7862?C LI\u202?N QUAN \u272?\u7870?N PH\u7846?N M\u7872?M HO\u7862?C EULA N\u192?Y.\par
\pard\f0\fs24 B\u7841?n c\u243? tr\u225?ch nhi\u7879?m sao l\u432?u d\u7919? li\u7879?u quan tr\u7885?ng tr\u432?\u7899?c khi s\u7917? d\u7909?ng c\u225?c c\u244?ng c\u7909? c\u243? th\u7875? thay \u273?\u7893?i \u7893? \u273?\u297?a, ph\u226?n v\u249?ng, c\u7845?u h\u236?nh kh\u7903?i \u273?\u7897?ng, ch\u7913?ng ch\u7881? ho\u7863?c thi\u7871?t l\u7853?p h\u7879? th\u7889?ng.\par
\par\pard\f0\fs28\b 13. Ch\u7845?m d\u7913?t\b0\par
\pard\f0\fs24 EULA n\u224?y c\u243? hi\u7879?u l\u7921?c cho \u273?\u7871?n khi b\u7883? ch\u7845?m d\u7913?t. TekDT c\u243? th\u7875? t\u7841?m ng\u432?ng ho\u7863?c ch\u7845?m d\u7913?t gi\u7845?y ph\u233?p c\u7911?a b\u7841?n n\u7871?u b\u7841?n vi ph\u7841?m EULA n\u224?y ho\u7863?c s\u7917? d\u7909?ng ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m sai m\u7909?c \u273?\u237?ch. Khi gi\u7845?y ph\u233?p ch\u7845?m d\u7913?t, b\u7841?n ph\u7843?i ng\u7915?ng s\u7917? d\u7909?ng ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m v\u224? g\u7905? b\u7887? n\u243? kh\u7887?i c\u225?c h\u7879? th\u7889?ng do b\u7841?n ki\u7875?m so\u225?t, t\u249?y theo c\u225?c quy\u7873?n c\u242?n l\u7841?i \u273?\u432?\u7907?c quy \u273?\u7883?nh b\u7903?i gi\u7845?y ph\u233?p c\u7911?a th\u224?nh ph\u7847?n b\u234?n th\u7913? ba.\par
\par\pard\f0\fs28\b 14. Tu\u226?n th\u7911?\b0\par
\pard\f0\fs24 B\u7841?n ch\u7883?u tr\u225?ch nhi\u7879?m tu\u226?n th\u7911? m\u7885?i lu\u7853?t, quy \u273?\u7883?nh, quy t\u7855?c xu\u7845?t/nh\u7853?p kh\u7849?u, ch\u237?nh s\u225?ch m\u7841?ng v\u224? \u273?i\u7873?u kho\u7843?n gi\u7845?y ph\u233?p c\u7911?a b\u234?n th\u7913? ba khi s\u7917? d\u7909?ng SEZOY.\par
\par\pard\f0\fs28\b 15. \u272?i\u7873?u kho\u7843?n \u225?p d\u7909?ng\b0\par
\pard\f0\fs24 N\u7871?u c\u243? m\u7897?t th\u7887?a thu\u7853?n b\u7857?ng v\u259?n b\u7843?n ri\u234?ng gi\u7919?a b\u7841?n v\u224? TekDT, th\u7887?a thu\u7853?n \u273?\u243? c\u243? th\u7875? \u273?\u432?\u7907?c \u432?u ti\u234?n \u225?p d\u7909?ng trong ph\u7841?m vi m\u226?u thu\u7851?n v\u7899?i EULA n\u224?y. N\u7871?u b\u7845?t k\u7923? ph\u7847?n n\u224?o c\u7911?a EULA n\u224?y b\u7883? xem l\u224? kh\u244?ng c\u243? hi\u7879?u l\u7921?c thi h\u224?nh, c\u225?c \u273?i\u7873?u kho\u7843?n c\u242?n l\u7841?i v\u7851?n ti\u7871?p t\u7909?c c\u243? hi\u7879?u l\u7921?c trong ph\u7841?m vi ph\u225?p lu\u7853?t cho ph\u233?p.\par
\par\pard\f0\fs28\b 16. Li\u234?n h\u7879?\b0\par
\pard\f0\fs24 N\u7871?u b\u7841?n c\u243? c\u226?u h\u7887?i v\u7873? EULA n\u224?y, vui l\u242?ng li\u234?n h\u7879? TekDT qua k\u234?nh h\u7895? tr\u7907? ch\u237?nh th\u7913?c \u273?i k\u232?m ph\u7847?n m\u7873?m.\par
